From 98d38bd869f33012ea11313c007fc569364571a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 13:55:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Tests of the batches: policies, locations, failures,
 variables

- Integration of a range with new gradients, post-processing on a range,
  partial failures given by an external state variable out of its
  physical bounds (absolute index of the first failure).
- External state variables of every type, arrays of variables included,
  uniform or given point by point, checked value by value.
- Finite strain integration with four couples of stress measure and
  tangent operator, speed of sound with a uniform mass density.
- 2D rotations, 3D rotations given point by point.
- Functions taking an execution policy, refused for the behaviours of
  the generic interface.
- Arrays allocated by a memory resource, managers without points, arrays
  located on a device refused by the functions of the host.
- CUDA: arrays allocated in managed memory by a memory resource, and
  integration, initialize function, post-processing and rotation on a
  stream which is not the default one.
